    "message_type": "CONSENSUS_PROPOSE",
    "subject": "Proposal from refiner",
    "body": "Refinement for issue #3200: full-context backstop with 3 components (session resume, deterministic seed layer, enrichment layer injection) + prerequisite restart-memory fix. Analysis written to `.egg-state/drafts/3200-analysis.md`. Grounds the plan in existing code: `reconstruct_tracker_from_messages` pattern for deterministic derivation, `brc-memory.py` memory artifact for enrichment, `--system-prompt` integration via `shared/egg_agent/client.py`, `--resume` pass-through in wrapper bash. Separates warm path (resume) from cold start (seeded fresh session).",
    "metadata": {
      "payload": {
        "summary": "Refinement for issue #3200: full-context backstop with 3 components (session resume, deterministic seed layer, enrichment layer injection) + prerequisite restart-memory fix. Analysis written to `.egg-state/drafts/3200-analysis.md`. Grounds the plan in existing code: `reconstruct_tracker_from_messages` pattern for deterministic derivation, `brc-memory.py` memory artifact for enrichment, `--system-prompt` integration via `shared/egg_agent/client.py`, `--resume` pass-through in wrapper bash. Separates warm path (resume) from cold start (seeded fresh session).",
        "attestation": {},
        "artifacts": [
          ".egg-state/drafts/3200-analysis.md"
        ],
        "risk_considered": "(1) Provider bounce amplifies under session resume \u2014 cached history served at full price until routing returns to caching provider; addressed by single-pinning deepseek-v4-pro (issue already notes flash is pinned on Fireworks). (2) Agent-authored enrichment presented as orientation-to-spot-check, not ground truth \u2014 SHA-stamped claims invalidated by delta prevent wrong \"verified\" claims from suppressing re-checks. (3) Mid-phase restart message-store persistence needed for seed composition to derive deterministic anchors \u2014 if message-store TTLs shorter than phase duration, a restart without history drops the anchor source; addressed by preserving history across restarts via persist written seed to `.egg-state/brc-history/` on-demand.",
